  <div class="fade"></div>
  <div class="c rev">
    <p class="k">Our promise</p>
    <h2>We take responsibility</h2>
    <p>Ensuring that the high standards we set for ourselves are maintained, from the craftsmanship behind the bottle and packaging, the balance and sillage of the scents, and to the quality and sustainability of the ingredients. None of these elements are ever compromised.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band tint" id="making">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="k">The making</p>
    <h2>Begun in Grasse. Finished by&nbsp;hand.</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <figure><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-480.avif?v=1fde4be5 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-960.avif?v=3765d682 960w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-480.webp?v=49eadac5 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-960.webp?v=5ad5650e 960w" sizes="100vw"><img class="figfull" src="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants.jpg?v=058397f4" alt="Botanicals for the compositions" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-480.jpg?v=3895ade1 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/plants-960.jpg?v=c541aad4 960w" sizes="100vw"></picture><figcaption class="hint">clean botanicals, carefully composed</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-480.avif?v=e4758b8c 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-960.avif?v=072fede8 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-1600.avif?v=787feb2e 1600w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-480.webp?v=1b8aa762 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-960.webp?v=57b4a5fd 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-1600.webp?v=9809c80f 1600w" sizes="100vw"><img class="figfull" src="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders.jpg?v=b4fe6c2f" alt="The house at work" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="828" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-480.jpg?v=90a401f5 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-960.jpg?v=6ab03efc 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/founders-1600.jpg?v=c53f60c3 1600w" sizes="100vw"></picture><figcaption class="hint">crafted with intention</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-480.avif?v=0dfcbd88 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-960.avif?v=597e68ec 960w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-480.webp?v=693f8f2e 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-960.webp?v=5cf34603 960w" sizes="100vw"><img class="figfull" src="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine.jpg?v=6fc84392" alt="Stone meeting glass" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-480.jpg?v=34f64303 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/spine-960.jpg?v=ac7ff882 960w" sizes="100vw"></picture><figcaption class="hint">made to last, designed to be reused</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="cols cols-3">
      <p>All Side Story fragrances begin with clean, natural ingredients, selected for their purity and character. Our farm-to-fragrance approach preserves every botanical, using synthetics only when they provide the most sustainable solution, without compromising the integrity of each scent.</p>
      <p>Every bottle and lid is crafted by hand in Italy, designed to be treasured long after the fragrance is finished. Made from recyclable materials and presented in entirely plastic-free packaging, every detail reflects thoughtful design and enduring craftsmanship.</p>
      <p>Every parfum is created to linger beautifully on skin and fabric, leaving a lasting impression long after it is worn. Inspired by stories instead of seasons or trends, each fragrance is composed with depth, purpose and timeless character.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="stones">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="k">Why Side Story?</p>
    <h2>Perfumers</h2>
    <p class="lede">Side Story strikes a&nbsp;fine balance between luxury and accessibility that is largely missing in the perfume&nbsp;market.</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <figure><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-480.avif?v=f02e336a 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-960.avif?v=e6e96135 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-1600.avif?v=ebfb9f0b 1600w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-480.webp?v=9b545910 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-960.webp?v=17f62665 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-1600.webp?v=5a1373c3 1600w" sizes="100vw"><img class="figfull" src="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf.jpg?v=5168998a" alt="Raw materials and a carved stone lid" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1800" height="1200" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-480.jpg?v=22c8f221 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-960.jpg?v=8c40db6e 960w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/stone-shelf-1600.jpg?v=2f49b4ad 1600w" sizes="100vw"></picture><figcaption class="hint">fine raw materials from Grasse, Provence</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-480.avif?v=c30d6b35 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-960.avif?v=2c50c630 960w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-480.webp?v=7f39b1dc 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-960.webp?v=ca48dc4a 960w" sizes="100vw"><img class="figfull" src="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines.jpg?v=56fb700f" alt="The Discovery Set discovery set" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-480.jpg?v=09fd8910 480w, https://sidestory-rho.vercel.app/assets/img/set-first-lines-960.jpg?v=af5a91f0 960w" sizes="100vw"></picture><figcaption class="hint">a more reachable price</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="cols cols-2">
      <p>On one hand, we use fine raw materials from Grasse, Provence, and other exceptional sources, and we collaborate with skilled master perfumers such as Jacques Chabert and Argeville who elevate the concept behind each fragrance to a form of high art.</p>
      <p>On the other, each of our &lsquo;stories&rsquo; is meant to resonate with consumers on a universal level and we have consciously decided to price the fragrances at a more reachable price than brands with similarly high manufacturing standards.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

